{"body":{"company_id":1321,"company_name":"Nestlé Vietnam Limited","describle":"Nestlé with headquarters in Vevey, Switzerland was founded in 1866 by Henri Nestlé and is today the world's leading nutrition, health and wellness company. We have around 275.000 employees worldwide, 344 factories in 77 countries, over 2.000 brands and 1 billion Nestlé products sold every day.rnrnThe Company's strategy is guided by several fundamental principles. \nNestlé's existing products grow through innovation and renovation while maintaining a balance in geographic activities and product lines.  Long-term potential is never sacrificed for short-term performance.  \nThe Company's priority is to bring the best and most relevant products to people, wherever they are, whatever their needs, throughout their lives.rnrnNestlé Vietnam Ltd., established in March 1995. We have 06 factories in Vietnam, produces Milo, Nescafé, Maggi, Nestea and La Vie.","industry_id":20,"phone_number":"0229195281","scale_id":6},"ip":"::1","level":"warn","message":"[CLIENT ERROR] Thiếu thông tin công ty hoặc ID hồ sơ Thiếu thông tin công ty hoặc ID hồ sơ","method":"PUT","path":"/employer/profile","query":{},"statusCode":400,"timestamp":"2025-04-22 15:49:25","url":"/employer/profile","userAgent":"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/135.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/135.0.0.0","userId":"unauthenticated","userRole":"none"}
